        {
          "issue_slug": "guns",
          "excerpt": "Frankel supports gun control measures, which she calls 'common-sense legislation.' Specifically, she supports a high-capacity magazine ban, universal background checks, and a ban on bump stocks. Frankel supports repealing the 1996 Dickey Amendment, which discourages the CDC from researching gun violence prevention.",
          "source": "wikipedia",
          "source_url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lois_Frankel"
        }
